misappropriation-403.l4:531:1-68:
  "You, Tan Boon Huat, are charged that you, on or about the 12th day of June 2022, at about 4.30 pm, at Lorong Chuan, Singapore, did dishonestly misappropriate movable property, to wit, one umbrella valued at about $120/-, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 403 of the Penal Code 1871."
misappropriation-403.l4:532:1-70:
  "You, Tan Boon Huat, are charged that you, on or about the 12th day of June 2022, at about 4.30 pm, at Lorong Chuan, Singapore, did dishonestly misappropriate and convert to your own use movable property, to wit, one horse jointly owned with Lim Ah Seng, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 403 of the Penal Code 1871."
misappropriation-403.l4:533:1-80:
  "A charge under section 403 would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of dishonest misappropriation of property (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: dishonestly (section 24)."
misappropriation-403.l4:534:1-61:
  "A charge under section 403 would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of dishonest misappropriation of property (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: movable property (section 22)."
